        "detailed_description": "<h1>Showcased at Get Into Games Birmingham 2026</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/f5cf8e72d5a662dcf36ddef085bf0a67.avif?t=1786969006\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras_big/f5cf8e72d5a662dcf36ddef085bf0a67.avif?t=1786969006 width=1560 height=716 /></span>Mawkey: The Last Macaw was selected to be showcased at Get Into Games Birmingham 2026,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a UK-wide free games festival supporting emerging developers and creative talent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was presented alongside other indie projects as part of the event’s</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >showcase programme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🦜Mawkey The Last Macaw is a 2D pixel art adventure in which we control Mawkey, trying to prevent the destruction of the environment and the mistreatment of animals in Honduras.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/d10595b938898766b0743f04d618a11c.poster.avif?t=1786969006\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/d10595b938898766b0743f04d618a11c.webm?t=1786969006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/d10595b938898766b0743f04d618a11c.mp4?t=1786969006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deforestation and fires caused by the evil businessman Adreim lead to the extinction of all the scarlet macaws in Honduras, leaving Mawkey alone on his journey.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/41c4c0c435a8f9fea7ffa3cf86d7913b.poster.avif?t=1786969006\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/41c4c0c435a8f9fea7ffa3cf86d7913b.webm?t=1786969006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/41c4c0c435a8f9fea7ffa3cf86d7913b.mp4?t=1786969006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>This game is inspired by games like: Rayman, Donkey Kong and Mario Bros.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/38549244ff1bf0eb77d63386de770db1.poster.avif?t=1786969006\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/38549244ff1bf0eb77d63386de770db1.webm?t=1786969006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/38549244ff1bf0eb77d63386de770db1.mp4?t=1786969006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>We will have a total of 5 Bosses throughout the game, making it a somewhat challenging game for those casual players looking for a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/ea84c1361c3bf138b66d56b1afb3344d.poster.avif?t=1786969006\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/ea84c1361c3bf138b66d56b1afb3344d.webm?t=1786969006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/ea84c1361c3bf138b66d56b1afb3344d.mp4?t=1786969006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game reflects what is happening in the world today, something that we humans do not see and do not want to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mawkey’s Allies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout his journey, Mawkey will meet five animals who will help him pass various levels. Their names are:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colimbus: The Emerald Hummingbird. He will help you by revealing the hidden cages where hunters have captured several exotic Honduran parrots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trukki: The strongest toucan in his family. He can hold Mawkey to prevent him from falling into the void between the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Xerothillo: This little friend helps you shrink to fit into small spaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flyo: A dove with a lot of flow that will allow you to run at incredible speeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mowsy: The white bat in charge of guiding you with his echolocation through extremely dark caves where nothing can be seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/9cacdf6d0250959540f7a698a9c90bfc.poster.avif?t=1786969006\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/9cacdf6d0250959540f7a698a9c90bfc.webm?t=1786969006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921580/extras/9cacdf6d0250959540f7a698a9c90bfc.mp4?t=1786969006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please support this project by adding it to your wishlist.</p>",
